eapartment buildings. Chat was very helpful. I started a notebook on the topic too. Once thetranscript is available from the planning board meeting, it should be useful. Donhttps://www.therecorder.org/post/neighbors-cool-to-katonah-church-s-plan-for-subdivision?fbclid=PAT01DUAUSLLFwZG9mAmV4dG4DYWVtAjEwAHNydGMGYXBwX2lkDzU2NzA2NzM0MzM1MjQyNwABp9y3IRXkK1cTKLa1BO13ZMDiUyFfE83GwgMwM8Bmpf33MdrqB82PKTRaJ2--_aem_P3oFvGVQqL1C-0lUKkZnjg',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,0);
